{"page":271,"verses":[{"verse_key":"16:35","surah":16,"ayah":35,"ar_uthmani":"وَقَالَ ٱلَّذِينَ أَشْرَكُوا۟ لَوْ شَآءَ ٱللَّهُ مَا عَبَدْنَا مِن دُونِهِۦ مِن شَىْءٍ نَّحْنُ وَلَآ ءَابَآؤُنَا وَلَا حَرَّمْنَا مِن دُونِهِۦ مِن شَىْءٍ ۚ كَذَٰلِكَ فَعَلَ ٱلَّذِينَ مِن قَبْلِهِمْ ۚ فَهَلْ عَلَى ٱلرُّسُلِ إِلَّا ٱلْبَلَـٰغُ ٱلْمُبِينُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Those who worshipped others alongside God say, ‘If God had willed, we would not have worshipped anything but Him, nor would our fathers. We would not have declared anything forbidden without His sanction.’ Those before them said the same. Are the messengers obliged to do anything other than deliver [their message] clearly?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَقَالَ","en_gloss":"And said","transliteration":"waqāla","verse_key":"16:35"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"16:35"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَشْرَكُوا۟","en_gloss":"associate partners (with Allah)","transliteration":"ashrakū","verse_key":"16:35"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَوْ","en_gloss":"If","transliteration":"law","verse_key":"16:35"},{"pos":5,"ar":"شَآءَ","en_gloss":"Allah (had) willed","transliteration":"shāa","verse_key":"16:35"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah (had) willed","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"16:35"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"16:35"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عَبَدْنَا","en_gloss":"we (would) have worshipped","transliteration":"ʿabadnā","verse_key":"16:35"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"other than Him","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"16:35"},{"pos":10,"ar":"دُونِهِۦ","en_gloss":"other than Him","transliteration":"dūnihi","verse_key":"16:35"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"any","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"16:35"},{"pos":12,"ar":"شَىْءٍۢ","en_gloss":"thing","transliteration":"shayin","verse_key":"16:35"},{"pos":13,"ar":"نَّحْنُ","en_gloss":"we","transliteration":"naḥnu","verse_key":"16:35"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَلَآ","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"16:35"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ءَابَآؤُنَا","en_gloss":"our forefathers","transliteration":"ābāunā","verse_key":"16:35"},{"pos":16,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"16:35"},{"pos":17,"ar":"حَرَّمْنَا","en_gloss":"we (would) have forbidden","transliteration":"ḥarramnā","verse_key":"16:35"},{"pos":18,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"other than Him","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"16:35"},{"pos":19,"ar":"دُونِهِۦ","en_gloss":"other than Him","transliteration":"dūnihi","verse_key":"16:35"},{"pos":20,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"anything","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"16:35"},{"pos":21,"ar":"شَىْءٍۢ ۚ","en_gloss":"anything","transliteration":"shayin","verse_key":"16:35"},{"pos":22,"ar":"كَذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"Thus","transliteration":"kadhālika","verse_key":"16:35"},{"pos":23,"ar":"فَعَلَ","en_gloss":"did","transliteration":"faʿala","verse_key":"16:35"},{"pos":24,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"16:35"},{"pos":25,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"(were) before them","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"16:35"},{"pos":26,"ar":"قَبْلِهِمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"(were) before them","transliteration":"qablihim","verse_key":"16:35"},{"pos":27,"ar":"فَهَلْ","en_gloss":"Then is (there)","transliteration":"fahal","verse_key":"16:35"},{"pos":28,"ar":"عَلَى","en_gloss":"on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"16:35"},{"pos":29,"ar":"ٱلرُّسُلِ","en_gloss":"the messengers","transliteration":"l-rusuli","verse_key":"16:35"},{"pos":30,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"16:35"},{"pos":31,"ar":"ٱلْبَلَـٰغُ","en_gloss":"the conveyance","transliteration":"l-balāghu","verse_key":"16:35"},{"pos":32,"ar":"ٱلْمُبِينُ","en_gloss":"clear","transliteration":"l-mubīnu","verse_key":"16:35"},{"pos":33,"ar":"٣٥","en_gloss":"(35)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"16:35"}]},{"verse_key":"16:36","surah":16,"ayah":36,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ بَعَثْنَا فِى كُلِّ أُمَّةٍ رَّسُولًا أَنِ ٱعْبُدُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ وَٱجْتَنِبُوا۟ ٱلطَّـٰغُوتَ ۖ فَمِنْهُم مَّنْ هَدَى ٱللَّهُ وَمِنْهُم مَّنْ حَقَّتْ عَلَيْهِ ٱلضَّلَـٰلَةُ ۚ فَسِيرُوا۟ فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ فَٱنظُرُوا۟ كَيْفَ كَانَ عَـٰقِبَةُ ٱلْمُكَذِّبِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We sent a messenger to every community, saying, ‘Worship God and shun false gods.’ Among them were some God guided; misguidance took hold of others. So travel through the earth and see what was the fate of those who denied the truth.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَقَدْ","en_gloss":"And certainly","transliteration":"walaqad","verse_key":"16:36"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بَعَثْنَا","en_gloss":"We sent","transliteration":"baʿathnā","verse_key":"16:36"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"into","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"16:36"},{"pos":4,"ar":"كُلِّ","en_gloss":"every","transliteration":"kulli","verse_key":"16:36"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أُمَّةٍۢ","en_gloss":"nation","transliteration":"ummatin","verse_key":"16:36"},{"pos":6,"ar":"رَّسُولًا","en_gloss":"a Messenger","transliteration":"rasūlan","verse_key":"16:36"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَنِ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"ani","verse_key":"16:36"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱعْبُدُوا۟","en_gloss":"Worship","transliteration":"uʿ'budū","verse_key":"16:36"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"16:36"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَٱجْتَنِبُوا۟","en_gloss":"and avoid","transliteration":"wa-ij'tanibū","verse_key":"16:36"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلطَّـٰغُوتَ ۖ","en_gloss":"the false deities","transliteration":"l-ṭāghūta","verse_key":"16:36"},{"pos":12,"ar":"فَمِنْهُم","en_gloss":"Then among them","transliteration":"famin'hum","verse_key":"16:36"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مَّنْ","en_gloss":"(were some) whom","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"16:36"},{"pos":14,"ar":"هَدَى","en_gloss":"Allah guided","transliteration":"hadā","verse_key":"16:36"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah guided","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"16:36"},{"pos":16,"ar":"وَمِنْهُم","en_gloss":"and among the